  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If VRC ever adds a prop/inventory system, I think a good subcategory would be a photo share tool. Right now the only way to share photos from your PC with friends is through third party applications such as Discord.\n\nI think a much more convenient method would be a photo tool that lets you select an image file and have it appear in the game as a grabbable and scalable prop. \n\nIt would be very fun and convenient. Anything from sharing a funny meme with people, to pulling up a reference photo for use in drawing worlds.\n\nOf course, there would be a file size limit, and the feature would have to have basic safety settings such as disabled or friends only for those who don't want to risk seeing anything inappropriate.",
